        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A04-P8600 Decorative L'Enfant Door Push Plate 3\" Wide x 16-1/2\" High</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe design is based loosely on the Russian design made popular in the 1920's this piece features the classical dolphin and cornucopia under a strong transom arched top. Comes complete with matching finish mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <b><a href=\"/products/lenfant-european-solid-brass-pull-plate-brass-accent-a04-p8601\">L'Enfant European Style Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  Brass Accents A04-P8600 Decorative L'Enfant Push Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flat Surface: 2-1/16\" x 8-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>",
